    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Faction Mechanics:\nGilded Supremacy: Gain a powerful faction buff when
    controlling more goldmines than your opponent.\nSculpted War Machine: Build radiant
    golems, artificial structures and high-cost, high-impact armies.\n\nLore:\L The
    Carrari did not rise from war, but from vision. Their civilization was powered
    by two sacred substances: Carrarit, flawless living stone and Goldessence, a
    refined golden fluid extracted through deep alchemy. With these, they sculpted
    golems, constructed radiant cities and designed artificial ecosystems devoid
    of chance or decay.\nTo the Carrari, perfection is not a goal, it is an obligation.\nNow,
    as their resources dwindle, they enter the Tournament not in fear but in pride.
    They do not seek godhood, they believe they already achieved it. What remains
    is to impose that order upon all others."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
