  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Faction Mechanics:\nBe One with the Curse: Resurrect fallen Pawns on the
    battlefield into Bishops, Knights or Rooks using accumulated Curse.\nCurse Meter:
    Track your corruption\u2019s progress across three thresholds to unlock devastating
    faction-wide effects.\n\nLore:\LThe Cursed Ones were once scholars and mapmakers.
    But beneath their world they uncovered something never meant to be found, a sealed
    prison, crafted by the gods to contain a power older than divinity itself. They
    broke it open. And slowly the Curse began.\nIt whispered into their minds. Twisted
    their cities. And they welcomed it.\nNow, they see the Curse not as infection
    but as revelation. They reject the gods who buried this truth and embrace the
    power that seeps from its release. Where others seek control, the Cursed Ones
    seek spread.\nThey enter the Tournament not to survive or win, but to reclaim
    what was stolen and let the Curse grow across every battlefield, one corpse at
    a time."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
